{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-08_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-08","title":"No Promises","storyCode":"2-8","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"4ce984ec2ebdb932c116fae92a6fc15bcb1159c62d6df2b60a4a3b84ce39f145","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Amiya had the premonition that things would not end so easily, however.\nElsewhere, a conversation between Crownslayer and Talulah suggests that something major is about to happen.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"L.G.D.'s escort team has managed to leave safely."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"But... it doesn't look like our enemies have any intention on letting us go."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"As long as they don't know that Misha has left with the L.G.D., they'll continue to focus their efforts on us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Misha will be safer this way."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Now that I think about it, why are both Reunion and Lungmen after this kid?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't say for sure. There are a lot of possibilities."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"My best guess is that either she, or something she knows, is significant enough to determine Lungmen's continued safety."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Something?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, perhaps some intel or information..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"So that's why both Lungmen and Reunion are after her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"What a dangerous contest..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"And none of us can stay out of it, not us, Misha, or the L.G.D."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Hopefully we don't end up caught in the crossfire."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"We don't know anything, but we have to take care of everything..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I, I'm not quite sure..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But as for Madam Ch'en..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I have a hunch... that things aren't going to end so smoothly."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, is there anything left for us to do?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Should we accompany you back to Rhodes Island?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No thank you. Nothing is holding us back in combat anymore, so we should be fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"If that's the case, we'll head back and wait for further orders."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No problem."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Moving forward, I hope you'll continue to keep an eye out on Reunion's movements within Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Even though we've handed Misha over to the L.G.D., the fact that Reunion is here... still makes me uneasy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Easily done~ We'll be on our way now~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Mhm. I'll leave you to it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Everyone, we don't know how many more Reunion members there are in hiding."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Make sure to stay prepared and alert."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Next, we'll continue to relocate our operations within these high-rises."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"If necessary, we can even use the rooftops."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"This way, we'll have a terrain advantage versus having to fight Reunion out in the streets."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"If necessary, we'll draw them towards areas that we control!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Operators","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Roger!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"Talulah."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"The preparations are complete."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"It's time to make our move."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"--Speak."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"There actually is a strategic purpose for us to attack Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"If we can take control of Lungmen, Reunion will have a huge advantage."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course, this comes with a high risk."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"...Why are you preoccupied with this idea?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you see that structure over there?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Crownslayer","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"I see it."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"That's the symbol of Lungmen... It's also..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"I didn't come back here just to return everything that has been taken from the Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"I will also... make him pay."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"Above all... Don't you think that... things are getting very interesting?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't you agree... Talulah?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["Talulah"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["Exusiai"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["Liskarm"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["Crownslayer"]}]}
